<title>USA: Schnitzer Steel completes Proler tender.</title>
<headline>Schnitzer Steel completes Proler tender.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schnitzer Steel Industries Inc said it completed a tender offer to buy all of Proler International Corp's common stock at $9 a share.</p>
<p>The tender offer expired at midnight on November 29. At that time, 4.1 million shares -- or about 86 percent -- of Proler common stock had been tendered, Schnitzer said.</p>
<p>Before Schnitzer began the tender offer on Sept. 20, Proler had 4.7 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
